{"title":"Stirling Cloud","description":"Use Stirling PDF in your browser at stirling.com/app, with nothing to install or maintain.","unlisted":false,"space":"cloud","layout":"","article":"\n    <h1>Stirling Cloud</h1>\n<p>Stirling Cloud is Stirling PDF hosted for you at <a href=\"https://stirling.com/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">stirling.com/app</a>. Sign in, or select <strong>Skip →</strong> to try it as a guest (<a href=\"/Cloud/Account/\">Account and sign-in</a>).</p>\n<p>Your avatar at the bottom of the left bar opens <strong>Settings</strong> for your account, team, API keys and billing.</p>\n<p>Manual tools are free. Automation, AI and API calls use credits (<a href=\"/Cloud/Plans-and-Billing/\">Plans, credits and billing</a>).</p>\n<div class=\"cards cards-3\"><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"7.5\" cy=\"15.5\" r=\"5.5\"/><path d=\"m21 2-9.6 9.6M15.5 7.5l3 3L22 7l-3-3\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Cloud/Account/\">Account and sign-in</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Sign-in options, guest mode and deleting your account.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Cloud/Teams/\">Teams</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Invite people and share a plan.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"5\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M2 10h20\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Cloud/Plans-and-Billing/\">Plans, credits and billing</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Credits, spend caps and invoices.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Cloud/Files-and-Privacy/\">Files and privacy</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Where your files go and how long they are kept.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3l1.9 5.1L19 10l-5.1 1.9L12 17l-1.9-5.1L5 10l5.1-1.9L12 3z\"/><path d=\"M19 15l.9 2.1L22 18l-2.1.9L19 21l-.9-2.1L16 18l2.1-.9L19 15z\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Cloud/Processor-and-AI/\">Processor and AI on Cloud</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>What is different on Cloud.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 18 6-6-6-6M8 6l-6 6 6 6\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Cloud/API-and-MCP/\">API and MCP</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Call Stirling from code or an AI assistant.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<p>To learn the tools, see the <a href=\"/Tools/\">User guide</a>.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"doc-source\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-Tools.github.io/edit/main/docs/Cloud/Cloud.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M17 3a2.83 2.83 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5L17 3z\"/></svg>\n        Edit this page on GitHub\n      </a>\n    </div>","toc":"","pager":"<span></span><a class=\"pager-link pager-next\" href=\"/Cloud/Account/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">Next &rarr;</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">Account &amp; sign-in</span>\n      </a>"}